#: hrms/hr/onboarding_step/data_import/data_import.json
#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Data Import'
msgid ""
"<h3>Data Import</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Data import is the tool to migrate your existing data like Employee, "
"Customer, Supplier, and a lot more to our ERPNext system.\n"
"Go through the video for a detailed explanation of this tool."
msgstr ""
"<h3>Importation de données</h3>\n"
"\n"
"L'importation de données est l'outil permettant de migrer vos données "
"existantes telles que les employés, les clients, les fournisseurs et bien "
"d'autres vers notre système ERPNext.\n"
"Regardez la vidéo pour une explication détaillée de cet outil."

#: hrms/hr/onboarding_step/create_employee/create_employee.json
#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Create Employee'
msgid ""
"<h3>Employee</h3>\n"
"\n"
"An individual who works and is recognized for his rights and duties in your "
"company is your Employee. You can manage the Employee master. It captures "
"the demographic, personal and professional details, joining and leave "
"details, etc."
msgstr ""
"<h3>Employé</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Une personne qui travaille et est reconnue pour ses droits et devoirs dans "
"votre entreprise est votre employé. Vous pouvez gérer la fiche employé. "
"Elle contient les informations démographiques, personnelles et "
"professionnelles, les détails d'embauche et de congés, etc."

#: hrms/hr/onboarding_step/hr_settings/hr_settings.json
#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'HR Settings'
msgid ""
"<h3>HR Settings</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Hr Settings consists of major settings related to Employee Lifecycle, Leave "
"Management, etc. Click on Explore, to explore Hr Settings."
msgstr ""
"<h3>Paramètres RH</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Les paramètres RH regroupent les principaux réglages liés au cycle de vie "
"de l'employé, à la gestion des congés, etc. Cliquez sur Explorer pour "
"découvrir les paramètres RH."

#: hrms/payroll/doctype/salary_component/salary_component.json
#. Content of the 'Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Salary Component'
msgid ""
"<h3>Help</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Notes:</p>\n"
"\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Use field <code>base</code> for using base salary of the Employee</li>\n"
"<li>Use Salary Component abbreviations in conditions and formulas. <code>BS "
"= Basic Salary</code></li>\n"
"<li>Use field name for employee details in conditions and formulas. "
"<code>Employment Type = employment_type</code><code>Branch = "
"branch</code></li>\n"
"<li>Use field name from Salary Slip in conditions and formulas. "
"<code>Payment Days = payment_days</code><code>Leave without pay = "
"leave_without_pay</code></li>\n"
"<li>Direct Amount can also be entered based on Condition. See example "
"3</li></ol>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Examples</h4>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Calculating Basic Salary based on <code>base</code>\n"
"<pre><code>Condition: base &lt; 10000</code></pre>\n"
"<pre><code>Formula: base * .2</code></pre></li>\n"
"<li>Calculating HRA based on Basic Salary<code>BS</code> \n"
"<pre><code>Condition: BS &gt; 2000</code></pre>\n"
"<pre><code>Formula: BS * .1</code></pre></li>\n"
"<li>Calculating TDS based on Employment Type<code>employment_type</code> \n"
"<pre><code>Condition: employment_type==\"Intern\"</code></pre>\n"
"<pre><code>Amount: 1000</code></pre></li>\n"
"</ol>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Aide</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Notes :</p>\n"
"\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Utilisez le champ <code>base</code> pour utiliser le salaire de base de "
"l'employé</li>\n"
"<li>Utilisez les abréviations des composantes salariales dans les "
"conditions et les formules. <code>BS = Basic Salary</code></li>\n"
"<li>Utilisez le nom du champ pour les détails de l'employé dans les "
"conditions et les formules. <code>Employment Type = "
"employment_type</code><code>Branch = branch</code></li>\n"
"<li>Utilisez le nom du champ du bulletin de salaire dans les conditions et "
"les formules. <code>Payment Days = payment_days</code><code>Leave without "
"pay = leave_without_pay</code></li>\n"
"<li>Le montant direct peut également être saisi en fonction de la "
"condition. Voir l'exemple 3</li></ol>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Exemples</h4>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Calcul du salaire de base basé sur <code>base</code>\n"
"<pre><code>Condition : base &lt; 10000</code></pre>\n"
"<pre><code>Formule : base * .2</code></pre></li>\n"
"<li>Calcul du HRA basé sur le salaire de base<code>BS</code> \n"
"<pre><code>Condition : BS &gt; 2000</code></pre>\n"
"<pre><code>Formule : BS * .1</code></pre></li>\n"
"<li>Calcul du TDS basé sur le type d'emploi<code>employment_type</code> \n"
"<pre><code>Condition : employment_type==\"Intern\"</code></pre>\n"
"<pre><code>Amount : 1000</code></pre></li>\n"
"</ol>"

#: hrms/hr/onboarding_step/create_holiday_list/create_holiday_list.json
#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Create Holiday List'
msgid ""
"<h3>Holiday List.</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Holiday List is a list which contains the dates of holidays. Most "
"organizations have a standard Holiday List for their employees. However, "
"some of them may have different holiday lists based on different Locations "
"or Departments. In ERPNext, you can configure multiple Holiday Lists."
msgstr ""
"<h3>Liste de jours fériés</h3>\n"
"\n"
"La liste de jours fériés contient les dates des jours fériés. La plupart "
"des organisations ont une liste de jours fériés standard pour leurs "
"employés. Cependant, certaines peuvent avoir des listes différentes selon "
"les sites ou les départements. Dans ERPNext, vous pouvez configurer "
"plusieurs listes de jours fériés."

#: hrms/hr/onboarding_step/create_leave_allocation/create_leave_allocation.json
#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Create Leave Allocation'
msgid ""
"<h3>Leave Allocation</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Leave Allocation enables you to allocate a specific number of leaves of a "
"particular type to an Employee so that, an employee will be able to create "
"a Leave Application only if Leaves are allocated. "
msgstr ""
"<h3>Attribution de congés</h3>\n"
"\n"
"L'attribution de congés vous permet d'allouer un nombre spécifique de jours "
"de congé d'un type particulier à un employé, de sorte qu'un employé ne "
"pourra créer une demande de congé que si des congés lui ont été attribués. "

#: hrms/hr/onboarding_step/create_leave_application/create_leave_application.json
#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Create Leave Application'
msgid ""
"<h3>Leave Application</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Leave Application is a formal document created by an Employee to apply for "
"Leaves for a particular time period based on there leave allocation and "
"leave type according to there need."
msgstr ""
"<h3>Demande de congé</h3>\n"
"\n"
"La demande de congé est un document formel créé par un employé pour "
"demander des congés pour une période donnée, en fonction de son attribution "
"de congés et du type de congé selon ses besoins."

#: hrms/hr/onboarding_step/create_leave_type/create_leave_type.json
#. Description of the Onboarding Step 'Create Leave Type'
msgid ""
"<h3>Leave Type</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Leave type is defined based on many factors and features like encashment, "
"earned leaves, partially paid, without pay and, a lot more. To check other "
"options and to define your leave type click on Show Tour."
msgstr ""
"<h3>Type de congé</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Le type de congé est défini en fonction de nombreux facteurs et "
"caractéristiques tels que l'encaissement, les congés acquis, les congés "
"partiellement payés, les congés sans solde et bien d'autres. Pour vérifier "
"les autres options et définir votre type de congé, cliquez sur Afficher la "
"visite guidée."

#: hrms/payroll/doctype/taxable_salary_slab/taxable_salary_slab.json
#. Content of the 'html_6' (HTML) field in DocType 'Taxable Salary Slab'
msgid ""
"<h4>Condition Examples</h4>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Applying tax if employee born between 31-12-1937 and 01-01-1958 "
"(Employees aged 60 to 80)<br>\n"
"<code>Condition: date_of_birth&gt;date(1937, 12, 31) and "
"date_of_birth&lt;date(1958, 01, 01)</code></li><br><li>Applying tax by "
"employee gender<br>\n"
"<code>Condition: gender==\"Male\"</code></li><br>\n"
"<li>Applying tax by Salary Component<br>\n"
"<code>Condition: base &gt; 10000</code></li></ol>"
msgstr ""
"<h4>Exempleformat@@1\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>Appliquer une taxe si un employé né entre 31-12-1937 et 01-01-1958 "
"(Employés âgés de 60 à 80 ans)<br>\n"
"<code>Condition : date_of_birth&gt;date(1937, 12, 31) et "
"date_of_birth&lt;date(1958, 01, 01)</code></li><br><li>Applying tax by "
"employee gender<br>\n"
"<code>Condition: gender==\"Male\"</code></li><br>\n"
"<li>Applying tax by Salary Component<br>\n"
"<code>Condition: base &gt; 10000</code></li></ol>"

